      "message": "tests: call the exported ecdh and ellswift hash functions\n\nsecp256k1_ecdh and secp256k1_ellswift_xdh notice when they are passed\nsecp256k1_ecdh_hash_function_sha256, secp256k1_ellswift_xdh_hash_function_bip324\nor secp256k1_ellswift_xdh_hash_function_prefix and call internal versions\ninstead, so the bodies of these exported functions never ran in the tests.\n\nCall them from custom hash functions and check the results against the\nexisting expected values. For the prefix function, use the BIP324 prefix\nso the BIP324 test vectors apply.",
